<decision #track.lifecycle_directories.single_root apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" blocks = [] durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M02EGVAXKD297KP0R9XSZXV2>
  Where should track lifecycle state live?
